{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And this stone.</b> Thus you shall explain this vav of וְהָאֶבֶן: 'If You will do these things for me, I will do this.'" "<b>And this stone which I have set for a pillar, etc.</b> As its Targum renders: it shall be a place of worship before YHWH. And so he did upon his return from Paddan-aram; when He said to him 'Arise, go up to Bethel' (there, 35:14), what is said there? 'And Jacob set up a pillar and poured a libation upon it.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:59.754520559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}